{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Free Castle: Survival Store&quot; is a first person store simulator in a post apocalyptic zombie invasion era.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready to Run a Store in the Dead Zone?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, trade, clean, fight\u2014and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival Store</strong> mixes simulation and chaos in a gritty post-apocalyptic setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every task you complete earns trust. Every mess you leave and every action you take might cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you keep the business alive when the world\u2019s falling apart?</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/LMG.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/store_management.png?t=1746960405\" /></div><i>Loot, haggle, and build your rep.</i> <br>Scavenge goods, bargain with stubborn survivors, and boost your reputation by keeping them alive\u2014and satisfied.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Trade.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/M9-Revolver.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong><i>Build your outpost from scratch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place furniture, set up defensive structures, and organize your survivor hub with total freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Placement.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/advance_infected_ai.png?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>They hear you. They see you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make a sound, and they\u2019ll come. Get spotted, and they\u2019ll chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Following.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/horde_combat.png?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Waves of undead. Endless bloodshed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face massive hordes in brutal combat. Use melee, guns, and traps to survive the swarm\u2014or get swallowed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Zombie_Fight_1.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/DT22.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/driving_mechanics.png?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Vehicles are your lifeline.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize, fuel, and drive vehicles to transport goods or escape the undead hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Driving.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/deep_cleaning.png?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Scrub the blood. Clean the grime. Earn their respect.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disinfect walls, floors, and surfaces to keep your store safe, usable, and infection-free. <br>A spotless store isn\u2019t just cosmetic\u2014it directly boosts your reputation and customer trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Cleaning.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/CV47.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Filth piles up. You clean it up.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up scattered junk, bag the waste, and keep your store from turning into a post-apocalyptic landfill. Trash-free zones boost your reputation and keep customers coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Trash_Collect.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/SMG.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/wall_painting.png?t=1746960405\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repaint your store\u2019s walls to cover the mess, mark your territory, or just feel human for a second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/Painting.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450410?t=1746960405","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450410?t=1746960405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/424126c41144dfb135a534c50e52b965804f2b26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746960405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/424126c41144dfb135a534c50e52b965804f2b26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746960405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Free Castle: Survival Store&quot; is a first person store simulator in a post apocalyptic zombie invasion era.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready to Run a Store in the Dead Zone?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, trade, clean, fight\u2014and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival Store</strong> mixes simulation and chaos in a gritty post-apocalyptic setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every task you complete earns trust. Every mess you leave and every action you take might cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you keep the business alive when the world\u2019s falling apart?</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/LMG.gif?t=1746960405\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/store_management.png?t=1746960405\" /></div><i>Loot, 